AGY Quota (agy-quota)
Copyright 2026 AGY Quota Contributors

This project is an independent native Antigravity 2.x UI sidepanel plugin
("SIDECAR_UI_ENTRYPOINT_AUX_PANE") focused exclusively on Antigravity account
quota monitoring.

